{"id":"7d5c58a3a73488b3","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-consensusclosure.md","title":"Consensus closure and term absorption order","display":"df-consensusclosure — Consensus closure and term absorption order","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-consensusclosure","aliases":["27-df-consensusclosure"],"display":"df-consensusclosure — Consensus closure and term absorption order","depends_on":["[[27-df-dnf]]","[[27-df-consensus]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§2.7 Definition 2.6; §3.2.2 consensus method","source_printed_pages":"93, 130–134","source_pdf_pages":"117, 154–158","verification_status":"source-construction-checked-explicit-finite-closure"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-consensusclosure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-consensusclosure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-consensusclosure — Consensus closure and term absorption order"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"15edfa8bdefed092\" href=\"?note=15edfa8bdefed092\" title=\"27-df-consensus\">27-df-consensus</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§2.7 Definition 2.6; §3.2.2 consensus method"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"93, 130–134"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"117, 154–158"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-construction-checked-explicit-finite-closure"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\">\\(D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\)</span>；DNF、项见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a>，部分 consensus 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"15edfa8bdefed092\" href=\"?note=15edfa8bdefed092\" title=\"27-df-consensus\">27-df-consensus</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConsTerm}\">\\(\\mathrm{ConsTerm}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"15edfa8bdefed092\" href=\"?note=15edfa8bdefed092\" title=\"27-df-consensus\">27-df-consensus</a> 的部分二元项运算；有定义的输出仍是项。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S_0(D)\\coloneqq D,\\qquad S_{r+1}(D)\\coloneqq S_r(D)\\cup\\{\\mathrm{ConsTerm}(T,U)\\mid(T,U)\\in(S_r(D)\\times S_r(D))\\cap\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{ConsTerm})\\}\\quad(r\\in\\mathbb N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S_0(D)\\coloneqq D,\\qquad S_{r+1}(D)\\coloneqq S_r(D)\\cup\\{\\mathrm{ConsTerm}(T,U)\\mid(T,U)\\in(S_r(D)\\times S_r(D))\\cap\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{ConsTerm})\\}\\quad(r\\in\\mathbb N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QCl}(D)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{r\\in\\mathbb N}S_r(D).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{QCl}(D)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{r\\in\\mathbb N}S_r(D).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T\\preceq U\\quad\\leftrightarrow\\quad\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(T(a)\\leq U(a))\\quad(T,U\\in\\mathrm{Term}_n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T\\preceq U\\quad\\leftrightarrow\\quad\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(T(a)\\leq U(a))\\quad(T,U\\in\\mathrm{Term}_n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>递增族始终包含于有限 Term_n（3^n 项），因而有限步稳定；这给出最小 consensus 封闭超集。闭包本身未作 absorption，取极大项才得到 prime 集。该节点把旧 quine 的核心构造从 Hypothesis 移到正式定义，供判据与算法复用。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-dnf","status":"resolved","id":"0b618255959ff4bc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-dnf]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-consensus","status":"resolved","id":"15edfa8bdefed092","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-consensus]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-dnf","status":"resolved","id":"0b618255959ff4bc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n$；DNF、项见 [[27-df-dnf]]，部分 consensus 见 [[27-df-consensus]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-consensus","status":"resolved","id":"15edfa8bdefed092","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n$；DNF、项见 [[27-df-dnf]]，部分 consensus 见 [[27-df-consensus]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-consensus","status":"resolved","id":"15edfa8bdefed092","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ConsTerm}$ 是 [[27-df-consensus]] 的部分二元项运算；有定义的输出仍是项。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ConsTerm}","display":false},{"tex":"S_0(D)\\coloneqq D,\\qquad S_{r+1}(D)\\coloneqq S_r(D)\\cup\\{\\mathrm{ConsTerm}(T,U)\\mid(T,U)\\in(S_r(D)\\times S_r(D))\\cap\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{ConsTerm})\\}\\quad(r\\in\\mathbb N).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{QCl}(D)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{r\\in\\mathbb N}S_r(D).","display":true},{"tex":"T\\preceq U\\quad\\leftrightarrow\\quad\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(T(a)\\leq U(a))\\quad(T,U\\in\\mathrm{Term}_n).","display":true}],"bytes":1705,"backlinks":[{"id":"9b156726c5da6a79","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$U,R,D\\subseteq\\mathrm{Term}_n$；$\\mathrm{QCl}$ 和部分运算 $\\mathrm{ConsTerm}$ 见 [[27-df-consensusclosure]]。"},{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-190","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-consensusclosure|df-consensusclosure — Consensus closure and term absorption order]]"},{"id":"dad46c0d84937bbd","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n$；$\\mathrm{QCl}$ 见 [[27-df-consensusclosure]]，$\\mathbf1_n$ 见 [[27-df-constfunc]]。"},{"id":"936e95274169e839","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$。$h\\in\\mathrm{PureHorn}_n$，$\\eta\\in\\mathrm{PureHornDNF}_n$，$\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(\\eta)=h$，$\\eta\\subseteq\\mathrm{QCl}(\\mathrm{PI}(h))$，$\\mathrm{StarIrr}_h(\\eta)$；源端计数和星不可约见 [[27-df-hornstar]]，闭包和素项见 [[27-df-consensusclosure]]、[[27-df-piset]]。"},{"id":"00ba4d3d5719420e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n$，$f=\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)$；$\\mathrm{QCl},\\preceq$ 见 [[27-df-consensusclosure]]，$\\mathrm{PI}$ 见 [[27-df-piset]]。"}],"outgoing":["0b618255959ff4bc","15edfa8bdefed092"]}